  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Occultism sphere, associated skill 5 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you select this feat, choose one (ritual) talent you possess—you gain the following benefits when using the chosen (ritual) talent:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can use the ritual an additional time per day without repercussion.</li>\n<li>You gain a +4 competence bonus to empowerment checks with the ritual.</li>\n<li>You treat your associated skill ranks as being 1 higher for determining the ritual’s effects.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, choose a different (ritual) talent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
